                                                "sense_id": "9dcf47fc-c00f-36ab-85a9-2f201d9879b6",
                                                "text": "So after learning a great deal about iron founding and much more about pike fishing, one regretfully took leave of a shop full of kindly characters and proceeded to a worse lot of odours in the brass foundry."
